Ferry Landing
Reeds crowd a slick wooden landing, and the river slides past it the color of strong tea. A mooring post leans into the current with a notice nailed to it. Tide marks stripe the pilings.
Elspeth stands beside the mooring post, watching each boat come in.
Exits: north, south, west
